# ConfigStore Usage
RULE: Use ConfigStore for runtime config (service params). Grid config uses domain buckets, NOT ConfigStore.
WHY: Enables persistence and hot reload for service parameters.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/config-types.md, unified-config-interface
DO: ConfigStore(bucket_name, service_name, schema_version); load_config(MyServiceConfig); hot_reloadable fields
NEVER: Use grid config for runtime params; skip ConfigStore for services with hot-reloadable config
